      "text": "The description omits the direction of a raw catalog equality, so a reader could pass `schema.catalog = db.catalog`, which `catalogFact` rejects for a variable `db`. Fix: Specify `db.catalog = schema.catalog` with a closed schema on the right and explain that one hint can serve both databases when their catalogs are definitionally equal."
